<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Galileo Intl started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Galileo Intl started.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch said on Tuesday it began coverage of Galileo International Inc with intermediate and long-term buy ratings, and named it as a Focus One stock.</p>
<p>-- Further details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- The stock gained 11/16 to 26-5/16.</p>
<p>((Wall Street desk))</p>
</text>
